{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1569888000, "end_date": 1570579199, "month_true_total": 65, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:53:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55508060", "author": {"steamid": "76561198427804107", "personaname": "铭人", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198427804107/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3465, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2722, "last_played": 1627993884, "avatar": "9f53eb16ed822a5e297059857581d6a278950399"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩到爆啊啊啊啊", "timestamp_created": 1570531683, "timestamp_updated": 1570531683, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55497554", "author": {"steamid": "76561198429212689", "personaname": "A𝓷𝔁𝓲𝓮𝓽𝔂🌸", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/harrycuris/", "num_games_owned": 781, "num_reviews": 173, "playtime_forever": 1262, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 250, "last_played": 1770050560, "avatar": "a1b94314efc9a4095eeec38b37cbb9c764391e4a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "玩这款游戏就像嚼口香糖，刚开始很有趣，随着时间的推移味道越来越淡直到丧失兴趣。\n联机能增加很多乐趣，延长一定的游戏时间，可惜我身边的小仙女小猪精们只玩王者荣耀和斗地主。\n主要是玩法太少了，推荐出PVP对抗模式，比谁更早完成任务，还能偷矿什么的。", "timestamp_created": 1570464320, "timestamp_updated": 1570464320, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.326424866914749146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55494629", "author": {"steamid": "76561198307065534", "personaname": "Byone（你的邻居）", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198307065534/", "num_games_owned": 214, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 45037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13021, "last_played": 1772720849, "avatar": "e8ef2b11eee5e2b7b13c3a82cbbbb5e4efdb454a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "如何拒绝一个不会跑路的开发者呢？", "timestamp_created": 1570450587, "timestamp_updated": 1634312214, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55492961", "author": {"steamid": "76561198355900725", "personaname": "Yoho ^", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198355900725/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 26647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7278, "last_played": 1738904581, "avatar": "6e41e880448337af2dd7b7635561ceba05b5e853"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "确实是个好游戏，适合有基友开黑【不过自己玩也不错】，但耐玩性不强，几十个小时后把所有模式和所有地图都玩了一遍后就没有新鲜感了，希望官方能多出一些新模式和地图。", "timestamp_created": 1570439916, "timestamp_updated": 1616064765, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55490314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198293678624", "personaname": "Citrus-橘子桑", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198293678624/", "num_games_owned": 282, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 14628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1778, "last_played": 1721148401, "avatar": "838590360639954d16d2c3136aa9a2d2750db88e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "都说啤酒不管饱，只是配料没搭好，吸铁石，铜矿，炸弹虫，你看着啤酒做的行不行，兄弟们喝就完了，奥利给！呕——\n我是深岩银河冬泳矿工，我这人很怪，41码的镐，吃45码的鞋（错乱)，有人说我是枪手，是侦察兵，说我是工程师，这些我都奥利给！我想说，矿工终日有，矿石自然无，矿石自然无，袜子终日有，袜子终日有，不听自然无，不听自然无，闲话终日有。我想把我这种.....这种...额....我忘了.....噢！！！把我这种无畏刁虫（？？？）传递下去，将老八蜜汁小汉堡随时随地的传递下去，我的双脚将化作灯塔，照亮你们挖矿的前程！加油，URBBR,JR奥油根！", "timestamp_created": 1570420998, "timestamp_updated": 1579667116, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 15, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.664558768272399902", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}